  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following sharp price spikes, especially when sentiment is neutral or negative.",
    "Adjust downward for persistent overestimation in early forecast periods when sentiment is positive but historical mean is lower.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias correction when true outcomes deviate significantly from recent 5-day average, especially after high sentiment volatility.",
    "Lower forecast for periods with increasing negative sentiment, particularly when true prices show downward momentum.",
    "Increase downward bias in forecasts when sentiment turns negative and historical prices show a clear downward trend.",
    "Avoid overreacting to short-term sentiment shifts; use 15-day moving average as a smoothing filter for price adjustments."
  ]
}
